        "content": "The only way to check it is to get permit nonces from base64 encoded [payout URLs](https://github.com/ubiquity/business-development/issues/2#issuecomment-1513070041) and check whether permits with those nonces have been redeemed from the `0xf87ca4583c792212e52720d127e7e0a38b818ad1` address (i.e. that there are [transactions](https://gnosisscan.io/address/0xf87ca4583c792212e52720d127e7e0a38b818ad1) which call `permitTransferFrom()` with the nonces that are missing from the audit page)",
